1
00:00:00,264 --> 00:00:01,644
Well, gotta run.

2
00:00:01,849 --> 00:00:05,309
(Alicia:)The guys promised to set up
my satellite dish and paint my bedroom.

3
00:00:05,477 --> 00:00:06,767
(Alicia:)Yay.

4
00:00:07,312 --> 00:00:09,902
(Penny:)Hey. Hey, can I talk to you about that
for a second?

5
00:00:10,107 --> 00:00:11,187
(Alicia:)About what?

6
00:00:11,942 --> 00:00:15,482
(Penny:)Well, you know,
it's just that Leonard and Howard and Raj...

7
00:00:15,696 --> 00:00:17,236
(Penny:)...they aren't like other guys.

8
00:00:17,823 --> 00:00:19,113
(Penny:)They're special.

9
00:00:19,575 --> 00:00:22,285
(Alicia:)Okay, they're special, and...?

10
00:00:23,037 --> 00:00:25,877
Let's see. How can I explain this?

11
00:00:26,123 --> 00:00:29,543
(Penny:)- They don't know how to use their shields.
- Shields?

12
00:00:29,752 --> 00:00:33,542
(Penny:)Yeah, you know, like in Star Trek when
you're in battle and you raise the shields?

13
00:00:37,801 --> 00:00:40,141
(Penny:)Where the hell did that come from?

14
00:00:41,430 --> 00:00:44,430
(Penny:)Anyways,
you know how guys like this are.

15
00:00:45,392 --> 00:00:48,232
(Penny:)So please don't take advantage of them.

16
00:00:49,438 --> 00:00:52,068
(Alicia:)Who says I'm taking advantage of them?

17
00:00:52,775 --> 00:00:56,735
(Penny:)Come on, they're doing everything for you
because you're leading them on.

18
00:00:56,945 --> 00:00:58,695
(Alicia:)So I let them do stuff for me.

